%% Source: raft-node Actor::run/execute/reply_request, Core::step/message/advance_commit,
%% Wal::save, StateMachine::apply. Static normal path, not an observed runtime trace.
%% Core and Exec share one actor thread. Omits node3, retries, faults and later commit notice.
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as 客戶端
    participant E as 執行器
    participant R as 共識核心
    participant W as 本地WAL
    participant F as 追隨者
    participant K as 本地KV
    C->>E: frame輸入
    E->>R: Propose事件
    R-->>E: Persist與Send
    E->>W: save與sync
    W-->>E: 同步成功
    E->>R: persisted通知
    E->>F: AppendEntries
    Note over F: 核對與同步後ACK
    F-->>E: durable ACK
    E->>R: 回覆事件
    R-->>E: 多數合法提交
    E->>K: Apply
    K-->>E: 保存結果
    E-->>C: 成功回覆
